  engagement.

  RELEVANCE: The classic periodization and critical evaluation of
  the tradition this domain covers. Anderson's account frames the
  intellectual conditions under which each thinker's philosophy of
  history developed, and his critique -- that Western Marxism
  retreated from political economy to culture and philosophy --
  remains the standard reference for situating the tradition within
  the broader history of Marxist thought.

  POSITION: Critical survey from a classical Marxist perspective;
  argues Western Marxism's turn to philosophy and aesthetics
  constituted a strategic retreat.
  },
  keywords = {Western-Marxism, Anderson, survey, historical-materialism, critique, High, INCOMPLETE, no-abstract}
